      "doc": "The organiser pauses the circle. Clocks stop; `resume` shifts every\\nstored window forward by however long it was down.\\n\\nThis is also the gate `upgrade` stands behind \\xe2\\x80\\x94 a circle must be\\npaused before its code can be swapped. With the vote gone there\\nwould otherwise be no way into that state at all, and the contract\\nwould be permanently unupgradable.",
