    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Reset the owner (`admin`) \\xe2\\x80\\x94 the platform-side recovery door. Gated on\\n`creator` (the system), which sits ABOVE `admin`: if a user loses their\\nkey, the system reassigns ownership to a fresh address. Distinct from the\\nowner's own two-step `transfer_admin`/`accept_admin` hand-off \\xe2\\x80\\x94 this is a\\ndirect set with no accept step, because a lost key can never complete an\\naccept. Clears any pending hand-off so state stays coherent.\\n\\nNOTE (scope): this reassigns the owner ROLE only. It does not move the\\nold owner's member record / funds \\xe2\\x80\\x94 those stay bound to the old address\\n(a member's payout requires that member's own auth). Member-fund recovery\\nis a separate concern, deliberately out of scope here.",
      "name": "set_admin",
