  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "The organiser removes a member. No vote, no automatic trigger.\\n\\nNobody is removed AUTOMATICALLY for not paying \\xe2\\x80\\x94 there is no violation\\ncounter and no auto-kick. A member who does not pay simply blocks the\\nround until the organiser decides to freeze them (this door) or anyone\\nvoids it. But a circle still needs that door: someone unreachable,\\nsomeone who asked to leave off-chain, someone who should not have been\\nlet in \\xe2\\x80\\x94 and, yes, someone stalling a round. In an acquaintance circle\\nthat call belongs to the person who assembled it, not to a 60% vote\\namong people who all know each other anyway.\\n\\nRemoval is not confiscation. It goes through the SAME door as a\\nvoluntary exit (`begin_exit`): an IMMEDIATE freeze that releases the\\nmember's slot and refunds any contribution they had staged into the\\nlive round. Nobody is ever removed for not paying \\xe2\\x80\\x94 the consequence for\\nfalling behind is being frozen out of payouts, not thrown out \\xe2\\x80\\x94 this\\ndoor is for the organiser's deliberate call.",
      "name": "remove_member",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "creator",
          "type_": "address"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "member",
          "type_": "address"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "result": {
            "ok_type": "u64",
            "error_type": "error"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
